From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Domenico D'Arrigo <DCHEM88@hotmail.it>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 10:19:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] cpu/intel/haswell: Make package C-state demotion a choice

configure_c_states() turned on package C-state demotion and
un-demotion (MSR_PKG_CST_CONFIG_CONTROL bits 29 and 30) on every
Haswell. Intel's reference code leaves them off by default, and so
does the Lenovo firmware of the ThinkPad W541 (GNET94WW: Package C
State Demotion and UnDemotion disabled in its CPU setup, the core C1
and C3 demotion on, as coreboot has them). On the W541 the package
stays in PC6 at idle, about 90% of the time, and never reaches PC7,
which its processor has.

Add CPU_INTEL_HASWELL_PKG_CSTATE_DEMOTION, on by default as before;
with it off, both bits are cleared.

TEST=Builds for the W541 with the option off. Remains for the hardware
test: tools/idle-report.py on the W541 with the screen off, the package
C-states and power with and without the option.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/cpu/intel/haswell/Kconfig        | 9 +++++++++
 src/cpu/intel/haswell/haswell_init.c | 8 ++++++--
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/cpu/intel/haswell/Kconfig b/src/cpu/intel/haswell/Kconfig
index 8025aa528d..7ce913a9b0 100644
--- a/src/cpu/intel/haswell/Kconfig
+++ b/src/cpu/intel/haswell/Kconfig
@@ -37,6 +37,15 @@ config MAX_CPUS
 	int
 	default 8
 
+config CPU_INTEL_HASWELL_PKG_CSTATE_DEMOTION
+	bool "Package C-state demotion and un-demotion"
+	default y
+	help
+	  Let the processor demote a package C-state request to a shallower
+	  one, and promote it back (MSR_PKG_CST_CONFIG_CONTROL bits 29 and
+	  30). Intel's reference code leaves both off by default, as the OEM
+	  firmware of the ThinkPad W541 does; coreboot has turned them on.
+
 config CPU_INTEL_NUM_FIT_ENTRIES
 	default 6
 endif
diff --git a/src/cpu/intel/haswell/haswell_init.c b/src/cpu/intel/haswell/haswell_init.c
index a376943321..e0e400dc7d 100644
--- a/src/cpu/intel/haswell/haswell_init.c
+++ b/src/cpu/intel/haswell/haswell_init.c
@@ -382,8 +382,12 @@ static unsigned int max_non_turbo_ratio(void)
 static void configure_c_states(void)
 {
 	msr_t msr = rdmsr(MSR_PKG_CST_CONFIG_CONTROL);
-	msr.lo |= (1 << 30);	// Package c-state Undemotion Enable
-	msr.lo |= (1 << 29);	// Package c-state Demotion Enable
+	if (CONFIG(CPU_INTEL_HASWELL_PKG_CSTATE_DEMOTION)) {
+		msr.lo |= (1 << 30);	// Package c-state Undemotion Enable
+		msr.lo |= (1 << 29);	// Package c-state Demotion Enable
+	} else {
+		msr.lo &= ~((1 << 30) | (1 << 29));
+	}
 	msr.lo |= (1 << 28);	// C1 Auto Undemotion Enable
 	msr.lo |= (1 << 27);	// C3 Auto Undemotion Enable
 	msr.lo |= (1 << 26);	// C1 Auto Demotion Enable
-- 
2.47.3

